  "quarter": "Summed over the three years, Q2 sells most (211,200) and Q4 least (138,297). Every quarter of 2021 beats the same quarter of 2019.",
  "stores": "Bob's Diner is in another league: 687,527 units, 99.0 percent of all volume. Among the other five, Surfs Up sells the most units and Fou Cher the fewest.",
